<title>USA: York's president replaces Nuss as CEO.</title>
<headline>York's president replaces Nuss as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>York Group Inc said on Tuesday its chairman and chief executive officer Eldon Nuss resigned as chief executive officer, and President and Chief Operating Officer Bill Wilcox would assume the additional role of CEO.</p>
<p>Nuss would remain company chairman, a post he has held since 1990, York said.</p>
<p>It said Wilcox's additional appointment was in keeping with the company's pre-determined succession plan.</p>
<p>York Group manufactures caskets and castket components.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
